($q$Bride in green, guests asked to avoid green$q$, $q$Bride stands out$q$, $q$The bride wears green and family and friends are asked, nicely and early, to wear other colours. Gives the cleanest photos, but needs a message in the family groups and some people will ignore it.$q$, $q$🚫$q$, $q$Decision$q$, $q$cards/wedding/mehndi-plan-1.svg$q$, $q$mehndi function outfits colours$q$, $q$[{"label": "Question", "value": "How do we handle green at the mehndi?"}]$q$, 1),
